---
description: rules for fetching data in react
globs: *.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---
- Use the existing react query nano store from here [query.ts](mdc:src/stores/query.ts)
- Be sure to set the client when using any hook from `react-query`
- Every react query should be pointing to an Astro Action
- Astro Actions can be found in `src/actions/*`
- Astro Actions can be accessed by importing `actions` from the package `astro:actions` and using `actions.*()`
- Gracefully handle errors in astro actions
- When needing to throw errors for the client to see, throw the `ActionError` class